sequenceDiagram
  participant Host as Host/QEMU
  participant BL as Bootloader
  participant K as Kernel
  participant VC as VController
  participant V1 as VComponent#1 (VHI)
  participant V2 as VComponent#2 (VHI)

  Host->>BL: Power on VM
  BL->>K: Load kernel + initramfs
  BL->>K: Pass cmdline (hfp=/etc/vdevice/hfp.yaml)
  K-->>VC: Start userland services
  VC->>VC: Read & parse HFP YAML (profiles, components, params)
  VC->>V1: Init over ut-control (WebSocket connect)
  VC->>V2: Init over ut-control (WebSocket connect)
  V1-->>VC: Init ACK + capabilities
  V2-->>VC: Init ACK + capabilities
  VC->>V1: Configure component (per HFP)
  VC->>V2: Configure component (per HFP)
  V1-->>VC: Config OK / status
  V2-->>VC: Config OK / status
  note over VC,V1: Control loop: start/stop, set params, inject events
  VC->>V1: Start
  V1-->>VC: Started
  VC->>V2: Start
  V2-->>VC: Started
  note over V1,VC: AIDL calls serve middleware/app requests
  V1<->>VC: Telemetry/health via ut-control
  V2<->>VC: Telemetry/health via ut-control
